POST https://Testresources.virginatlantic.com/dev/tripmicroservice/deeplink HTTP/1.1

[?(@.deeplinkOption == 10)]


###Response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Content-Encoding: gzip
Vary: Accept-Encoding
Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

{
    "deeplinkUrl": "https://www.virginatlantic.com/yourbooking",
    "deeplinkOption": 10
}